<title>POLAND: WARTA SIGNS DEALS ON NEW SHARE ISSUE.</title>
<headline>WARTA SIGNS DEALS ON NEW SHARE ISSUE.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish insurance company TUiR Warta SA signed an agreement with the state-owned Powszechny Bank Kredytowy SA (PBK) brokerage on offering its new share issue, Warta said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said Kredyt Bank would prepare the issue prospectus.</p>
<p>It did not give any details of the share issue and Warta officials were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>Earlier Warta has said it wanted to issue new shares to be taken up by a foreign or Polish strategic investor.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
